    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ChatWaifu is an Offline AI voice companion without internet required. One-click install latest LLM, optimized for low-end PCs with instant TTS. Support 3-second voice cloning, shareable voices directly in workshop. Integrates local tools for web access/news/weather/PC Control while staying fully offline </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully offline AI desktop voice companion that offers private, secure play without internet access. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports one-click import of various mainstream local AI large language model file</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Supports fast inference using Nvidia and AMD graphics cards and even CPUs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Support real-time TTS for voice chat and interaction </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Supports one-click import of 3D characters model</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports GPTSoVITS2's 3-second voice cloning, allowing users to download and share character voices  from the workshop </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Character models support custom outfits and custom poses, and can be auto switched by AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Supports LLM Function-Call to auto call tools to assist in information retrieval and script execution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Supports easily custom tools for querying information such as weather or news from the web, and supports JavaScript </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Optimized 3D-to-2D anime rendering engine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Support workshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Support multi-language </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Optimized code and lower resource usage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Compatible with all other game, software and live wallpapers</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ChatWaifu is an Offline AI voice companion without internet required. One-click install latest LLM, optimized for low-end PCs with instant TTS. Support 3-second voice cloning, shareable voices directly in workshop. Integrates local tools for web access/news/weather/PC Control while staying fully offline </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully offline AI desktop voice companion that offers private, secure play without internet access. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports one-click import of various mainstream local AI large language model file</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Supports fast inference using Nvidia and AMD graphics cards and even CPUs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Support real-time TTS for voice chat and interaction </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Supports one-click import of 3D characters model</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports GPTSoVITS2's 3-second voice cloning, allowing users to download and share character voices  from the workshop </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Character models support custom outfits and custom poses, and can be auto switched by AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Supports LLM Function-Call to auto call tools to assist in information retrieval and script execution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Supports easily custom tools for querying information such as weather or news from the web, and supports JavaScript </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Optimized 3D-to-2D anime rendering engine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Support workshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Support multi-language </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Optimized code and lower resource usage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Compatible with all other game, software and live wallpapers</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "ChatWaifu is an Offline AI voice companion without internet required. One-click install latest LLM, optimized for low-end PCs with instant TTS. Support 3sec voice cloning, shareable voices directly in workshop. Integrates local tools for web access/news/weather/PC Control while staying fully offline",
